@startuml account-page
title Account Page Target Feature Flow

' Purpose: Show the planned account-area flow for a later account feature slice.

actor User
participant "Account Page" as AccountPage
participant "Account Sections" as AccountSections

User -> AccountPage: Open account page
AccountPage --> User: Show account overview and available account actions

alt Account features are available for the current user
  User -> AccountSections: Open a profile or account-management section
  AccountSections --> User: Show selected account information or action form
  User -> AccountSections: Review or update account-related information
  AccountSections --> User: Confirm change or explain what requires later support
else Account features are not yet enabled in the app
  AccountPage --> User: Show placeholder account area and planned future capability
end

@enduml